      "title": "External Sampling example",
      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"},
      "widgets_values": ["## MiniMax H3 Motion Director — External Sampling\n\n- Motion Context: ON, 22 frames\n- Audio Context: ON\n- Sampling control: external\n- `MiniMaxH3SigmaShift` patches the H3 MODEL once\n- The same patched MODEL feeds Director and `BasicScheduler`\n- `KSamplerSelect` supplies `SAMPLER`\n- `BasicScheduler` supplies `SIGMAS`\n\nThe Director does not apply another sigma shift in external mode. The scheduler/model pair is validated before generation.\n\nChange the four model filenames to match your local files before Queue Prompt."]
    }
